1. PROJECT TITLE

---

Cloud-Based CAD Validation System using AWS Services, Spring Boot, FreeCAD
Integration, DynamoDB, Lambda, API Gateway and Machine Learning.

---

2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

---

The objective of this project is to build a cloud-native CAD validation
platform capable of validating CAD designs against predefined design rules.
The system integrates FreeCAD with a Spring Boot backend hosted on AWS EC2,
while AWS services such as DynamoDB, Lambda, API Gateway, and S3 provide
storage, validation, automation, and scalability.

---

3. PROBLEM STATEMENT

---

Manual validation of CAD designs is time-consuming and error-prone.
Engineers often need to verify multiple design constraints before production.

This project automates the validation process by:

• Extracting design data from FreeCAD.
• Sending data to a cloud-hosted validation engine.
• Checking design rules stored in DynamoDB.
• Returning violations automatically.
• Highlighting design issues inside FreeCAD.

